  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc78aac9f49c01d6",
      "translationZh": "使用 llama.cpp Ubuntu Vulkan 预编译二进制文件，以及配备 AMD Ryzen 7 6800H、搭载 64GB DDR5 RAM 的 Acemagic miniPC S3A。AMD Ryzen 7 6800H 是一款高性能的 8 核、16 线程移动处理器，于 2022 年 1 月 4 日推出，基于 6nm Zen 3+ 架构打造。它的基础频率为 3.2 GHz，加速频率为 4.7 GHz，TDP 为 45W，并配备性能强劲的 Radeon 680M 集成显卡（iGPU）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfb8e3b16381c9f0",
      "translationZh": "根据基准测试命令和 llama-bench 输出标签：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6e141cb1c0c0ac7a",
      "translationZh": "GLM-4.7-Flash-MXFP4_MOE.gguf（报告为：deepseek2 30B.A3B MXFP4 MoE | 15.79 GiB）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ac0b36e242e71346",
      "translationZh": "GLM-4.7-Flash-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf（报告为：deepseek2 30B.A3B Q4_K - Medium | 16.31 GiB）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "595b92c66229dc41",
      "translationZh": "GLM-4.7-Flash-Q4_K_M.gguf（报告为：deepseek2 30B.A3B Q4_K - Medium | 17.05 GiB）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "437c02b5c38735e2",
      "translationZh": "注意：文件名中包含 GLM-4.7，但 llama-bench 读取内部 GGUF 头部后，报告为 deepseek2 30B.A3B。基准测试数据对应的是参数量约为 30B 的 MoE 架构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c0bd929270cc534e",
      "translationZh": "平均性能结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20dd982dd7d07847",
      "translationZh": "模型文件名 报告名称 大小 平均提示词处理速度（pp512）t/s 平均词元生成速度（tg128）t/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "554a81aa0ae609b1",
      "translationZh": "deepseek2 30B.A3B MXFP4 混合专家模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "327809ad3547b1e5",
      "translationZh": "deepseek2 30B.A3B Q4_K - 中等",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f7f04b2f26ece41",
      "translationZh": "（数值为 3 次运行的算术平均值。fa on = 已启用 Flash Attention）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "12606627858ef298",
      "translationZh": "🔹 硬件与内存背景",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "93714e486f95a31c",
      "translationZh": "设备：AMD Radeon Graphics (RADV REMBRANDT) 集成 GPU",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3190bfb1147e057f",
      "translationZh": "架构：UMA（统一内存访问），fp16: 1 , bf16: 0 , fp4: 0",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6e32455eeef5c8c2",
      "translationZh": "影响：这些模型（约 16–17 GB）超过了典型 iGPU 的显存容量，因而必须卸载到系统 RAM。性能受到系统内存带宽（DDR5 约 50–65 GB/s）和 PCIe/NB 链路延迟的严重制约。fp4: 0 标志确认不支持原生 FP4 计算，因此 MXFP4 会在运行时进行模拟或转换。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3595bf0ce20067dd",
      "translationZh": "🔹 提示词处理（pp512）与生成（tg128）之间的权衡",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "425d8ee8eca9d6e4",
      "translationZh": "格式 PP 速度 TG 速度 最佳使用场景",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a91b1afeeeb0e4d0",
      "translationZh": "长上下文窗口、RAG、文档处理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea14584842cfd06b",
      "translationZh": "通用聊天、混合工作负载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14a5a5921b8745b2",
      "translationZh": "快速响应生成、流式用户界面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "97ae171e5234d9e0",
      "translationZh": "MXFP4 为何在 PP 中表现出色：尽管缺乏原生 FP4 支持，MoE 结构和极致量化仍大幅减少了注意力评分期间的活跃计算量和内存读取量。Flash Attention 进一步优化了提示词解析时的缓存局部性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "626a0cc3523dc47d",
      "translationZh": "Q4_K_XL 在 TG 中领先的原因：生成过程完全受内存带宽限制。Q4_K_XL 的量化布局似乎针对 RADV 驱动的内存预取进行了更好的优化，使流式 token 输出速度比 Q4_K_M 快约 13%，比 MXFP4 快约 12%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2f4a9624d43fe046",
      "translationZh": "🔹 一致性与稳定性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5b1cf8847917cfd",
      "translationZh": "所有运行的标准差都极小（TG 为 ±0.02–0.06 t/s），表明散热与供电稳定，且没有后台干扰。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0f743955869fa60a",
      "translationZh": "异常值：Q4_K_XL 的首次运行显示出较大的 PP 波动（±17.76 t/s），可能是由冷缓存／内存分配开销导致的。后续运行趋于稳定（±1.11 和 ±1.54），这是 VM／页缓存预热的典型表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "822c3d9617724db3",
      "translationZh": "用于聊天／流式输出：使用 Q4_K_XL。提示词处理速度稍慢，在典型的对话轮次中可以忽略不计，而更快的 TG 则能改善感知延迟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1b2236742057bc3a",
      "translationZh": "用于 RAG／长上下文：使用 MXFP4_MOE。PP 速度提升约 60%，大幅缩短了上下文加载的等待时间；对 TG 的轻微影响，对于批处理或可暂停的工作流程来说是可以接受的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26c21ca02cee1e5d",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/tabletuser_blogspot 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
